WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Teaching, course development and programming for staff training.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Independent MATLAB experiment, 2013. Display, mouse input and response logic.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Immediate automatically marked results. Written answers remained human graded.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Directed a course explorer with assisted implementation. Connect scores, probability and the curve.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
A TA guide adapted into three decisions, coaching and a job aid.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Brought three course sections fully online in under a month in 2020.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Explore the lesson, course materials and code. See what this work could bring to WES.
